  "details": "1. Position one hand so that another player's capsule will be highlighted when you open the small menu\n\n2. With the other hand, double press the menu button to open the big menu\n\n3. Move the big menu so that it overlaps with where the small menu would be if it were not hidden, if they were not already positioned that way\n\n4. Click on the big menu around where a small menu's button would be\n\nIt may take some clicking around to find a spot that clicks the small menu, but there are definitely places where the small menu gets selected despite being hidden. This only seems to happen when a user's capsule is highlighted when opening the big menu by double tapping the menu button. I've accidentally opened other tabs, calibrated FBT, or simply been unable to select users/worlds in the social tab because of this.",
